  "description": "ADO-EVENT, WillExecute versus ExecuteComplete object identity: a sink on the Connection; a Command (own object) with two ? markers and parameters 2 and 4 executes through Command.Execute; the same text executes through Connection.Execute; a Recordset.Open of the same text also runs. The sink records the Command and Recordset object labels, parameter state and arguments in each event. Asks whether the event's Command is the caller's object and what an event can observe of the parameters. (Changing parameters from inside an event is not possible with a recording sink: ADO-PARAM-EVENT stays T.)",
